1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,730
The calendar button jumps the chart to a date.

2
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:08,170
Type the date, month first.

3
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:14,690
Click Go. Older history is loaded if needed.

4
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:18,550
The chart now shows that day, in your app's time zone.

5
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:24,070
1D brings you back to today.

6
00:00:24,170 --> 00:00:30,660
% shows the price scale as a percentage change.

7
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:37,230
log uses a logarithmic scale, useful over long periods.

8
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:41,590
auto keeps all the candles in view as you scroll. It is on by default.

